        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-495 (ensure controlled execution — Records Compliance, e-Discovery &amp; BIR/SEC/NPC Audit (PA-88.3).) | - operational: 10-year retention and retrieval readiness
Owner: Tax Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
